# Burning Steppes - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 11 rares and the fixed world containers of the
# Burning Steppes. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route
# or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the
# route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper anywhere in
# the data is the rare. Ordinary goods and generic multi-zone world drops get
# a note, not a goal. No tame lines ship (the data has no tameability flag
# and no rare here presents beast-drop evidence with a core-guide beast-family
# kill to corroborate - the beast-shaped rares' tame questions are logged in
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so
# none are stated. Core-quest objects (Gor'tesh's Head, the Tablet, Kibler's
# cages) live in the core guide - see
# docs/burning-steppes-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory. This
# guide never accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/burning-steppes-rares
title Burning Steppes - Rares & Treasures
levels 48-60
zone Burning Steppes
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords burning steppes, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Kazon - the Morgan's Vigil road

  zone map 1428

  goto 71.1,85
  kill 584 optional
  collect 2058 "Kazon's Maul" optional
  collect 3231 "Cutthroat Pauldrons" optional
  note Level 27 rare ranging the eastern road; far below the band, so a trivial kill. Both drops come only from Kazon anywhere in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed. The tame question (ogre) is logged in docs/companion-unverified.md.

